#*
 Velocity #parse error include page.

 Spliced into a themed page where a failed #parse would have gone. The
 response is then sent as HTTP 500 and never cached (RenderErrorStatusTest).
 One neutral line that inherits the theme's own colours and type: no
 exception detail (that goes to the server log), no red block.
 Pinned by VelocityErrorTemplateTest.
*#
<!-- error-parse -->
<p class="roller-render-error" role="alert" style="margin: 1em 0; padding: .75em 1em; border: 1px solid currentColor; border-radius: 6px;"><strong>$text.get("errorPage.title")</strong> $text.get("errorPage.message")</p>
